{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Supersession record for the push-pending gating (implementation in progress, worktree fix-overweak2).\n\nPush-pending refusal at every gate came from 3 tickets, all closed:\n- `cibophobic-moist-guineafowl` (b928-3ab6-5985-417b): the deployed MCP clone could not push, so a valid completion attestation read as `unsigned` on a clone that never received it. Commit `2598909d25a` added `rebar._store.freshness` with 3 stale states: push-pending, behind, diverged.\n- `yummy-yogic-clam` (2d52-5abe-abb8-44ab): stranded agent writes; the trailer on `2598909d25a` and `710a606b6d3` (write-side no-common-ancestor refusal, which this change keeps).\n- `abnormal-dear-shoveler` (16c9-a42d-fd01-48b9): a stale marker wedged every gate after one failed push. Commit `8c5687af946` added `_pending_reconciled` / `_head_is_level_with` to discharge a marker that git disproved.\n\nWhy the 2026-11-03 decision supersedes them: b928's harm was a clone that had NOT RECEIVED shared writes (behind), and that case stays refused. Push-pending is the opposite case. The clone holds every shared event plus its own, so its view is a superset, not stale. Refusing on it made rebar unusable offline, against ADR 0045 and the operator requirement. The accepted trade-off is that a certificate can cover events the shared store has not received yet. With the marker no longer consulted by any gate, 16c9's wedge cannot recur, so its reconciliation helpers are deleted rather than kept as dead code. The marker is still written by `push_state.record_failure` and still reported by fsck (`PUSH_PENDING` from `_tracker_sync_status`), and `tests/interfaces/store/test_fsck_push_pending.py` passes unchanged.\n\nScope note: `tests/unit/plan_review/test_94a3_material_diff.py` also changed. Its 2 tests pinned the unconditional `sign-review` advice, and they now stub a recorded PASS to keep their original intent."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793732205410161001,"uuid":"32d27312-ade4-4930-848b-af28a7aa6104"}